empty: complete bytes verified
multichunk: complete bytes verified
warnings: complete bytes verified
incompressible: complete bytes verified
raw cap and success-before-overflow: incomplete on overflow
compressed cap: exact accepted, one-byte-over refused
truncated: refused
concat: refused
trailing: refused
bad-crc: refused
wrong raw hash: refused
decompression cap: refused
destination failure: incomplete
synthetic disk write failure: incomplete
same-inode rewrite: refused
producer signal status: not confirmed
failed spawn: incomplete metadata retained
cap with writer ignoring EPIPE: failure metadata published promptly
bad-json: not confirmed
empty-meta: not confirmed
large-meta: not confirmed
good-positive: matched
bad-exit: not confirmed
missing-marker: not confirmed
negative-full: matched
negative-exit-zero: not confirmed
negative-unrelated-failure: not confirmed
negative-missing-0: not confirmed
negative-missing-1: not confirmed
negative-missing-2: not confirmed
negative-missing-3: not confirmed
